WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:06.760
Bluey!

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:08.560
(PLAYS FANFARE)

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:11.200
Everyone, the Queen is coming in.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:16.680
Oh, it's the Queen.

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:19.040
Your Majesty, over 'ere!

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:20.240
Oh, hello.

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:22.360
Oh, I love you, Your Majesty.

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:23.680
Carry on.

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:26.960
Stop!

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:30.240
Butler, the royal bottom is itchy.

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:32.040
I demand you scratch it.

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:33.520
(BLUEY GIGGLES)

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:35.720
Oh, yes. That's the spot.

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:36.640
Very good.

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.640
Now, I demand to sit on the throne.

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:41.560
Hee-hee! Yes, my queen.

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:45.080
Eh! Ugh! Oopsie!

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:47.000
Oh, let me get that, Your Majesty.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:50.520
Ugh! The queen is having some trouble!

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:51.320
(BOTH GROAN)

00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:52.720
Ah, splendid!

00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:54.840
(CLAPS)
Now… go away.

00:00:54.840 --> 00:00:56.160
Yes, my queen!

00:00:57.280 --> 00:00:58.480
(BLUEY GIGGLES, 
BINGO CLAPS)

00:00:58.480 --> 00:01:00.200
Come here!
(BLUEY GIGGLES)

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:03.280
- Yes, Your Maj… 
- Ooh! Excuse me!

00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:06.040
You may not stand on the royal rainbow thing.

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:08.440
Oh, I'm terribly sorry, Your Majesty.

00:01:08.440 --> 00:01:10.000
Cheeky butler.

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:12.920
Hee-hee! Is this OK, Your Majesty?

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:14.880
Yes. 

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:16.720
How can I serve you, my queen?

00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:18.800
I'm going to sing a song.

00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:20.600
You will write it down. 

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:21.800
Ooh, OK!

00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:22.880
Ahem!

00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:26.440
# I am so beautiful!

00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:29.920
# I am so lovely!

00:01:29.920 --> 00:01:33.280
# Ooh, and sparkly! #

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:34.920
Now, sing it back to me.

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:36.200
Ahem!

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:39.440
# I am so beautiful! #
- Louder!

00:01:39.440 --> 00:01:41.520
- # I am so… #
- Louder!

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:44.360
#..lovely and sparkly! #

00:01:44.800 --> 00:01:45.600
Very good.

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:49.160
(CLAPPING)
Oh, our queen is so lovely and sparkly!

00:01:49.240 --> 00:01:50.240
(BOTH GIGGLE)

